OL,3,GNEWSATram strike to coincide with
OL,4,ANottingham's Goose Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FColin Whyatt, the regional organiser
OL,7,Ffor GMB, said members were "awfully
OL,8,Fsupportive", with 88% of them voting
OL,9,Ffor strike action.
